WEBVTT

00:10:59.641 --> 00:11:02.196
Because if you are beaten down,

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.950
if you have worked as hard as you can,

00:11:04.974 --> 00:11:07.689
if you have done everything
you said you should,

00:11:07.713 --> 00:11:09.286
and it still doesn't work out,

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.898
fatigue can sap you of your energy.

00:11:12.863 --> 00:11:15.303
But that's why you go back
to the "why" of it.

00:11:16.156 --> 00:11:19.446
Because I know we have to have women
who speak for the voiceless.

00:11:20.113 --> 00:11:22.478
I know we have to have people
of good conscience

00:11:22.502 --> 00:11:24.459
who stand up against oppression.

00:11:24.938 --> 00:11:26.684
I know we have to have people

00:11:26.708 --> 00:11:30.033
who understand that social justice
belongs to us all.